nts a preferred size and position for a window."}],"title":"WindowPlacement","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowplacement","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WindowPlacement"}],"type":"topic"}}}